}}===How to sign up===
You can sign up by submitting [https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdNyg-f8Dowj5_SebCpm2hhe0ehhJIuxRF3iaS9cvO63uMrTQ/viewform this signup form]. Make sure that you are available on tournament days and times before signing up.

===Rules===
* 10 min duels with 3 min overtime
* Allowed clients: 
**Open source clients (with source code publicly available on the internet) that have equivalent checks and restrictions as that of ezQuake's
*** Ruleset: qcon
*** Client has to answer to f_modified and do the same checks and restrictions as ezQuake's f_modified
*** Movement script prevention
*** Client has to answer f_version with proper information of client name/version/os
**** While this includes many clients like the latest ezQuake and unezQuake, there will be a client released prior to tournament start named '''ezQuake3.6-quakecon''' which we would encourage everyone to use.
* Upper bracket rounds are {{abbr|BO3|Best of 3}}, then {{abbr|BO5|Best of 5}} from Quarter-Finals
* Lower bracket rounds are {{abbr|BO3|Best of 3}}
* Server Picks: Four dedicated QuakeCon servers, located in Los Angeles, Dallas, New Jersey and Miami. You will be directed to the one that makes most sense geographically.
* Server version: KTX1.40+, antilag 1
* {{abbr|BO3|Best of 3}}: /rnd to determine who picks first. p1 pick, p2 pick, p1 toss from remaining maps, p2 toss from remaining maps, remaining map is played.
* {{abbr|BO5|Best of 5}}: /rnd to determine who picks first. p1 pick, p2 pick, p1 pick, p2 pick, if necessary, the last remaining map is played.
* '''All participants must join the [https://discord.gg/quakecon Official QuakeCon Discord], in which everything will be organized by QuakeCon staff.''' Every participant will be given a specific role so that you can see the tournament specific channels. 

===Tournament progression===
* '''Saturday August 7th:''' Tournament begins at 3:00pm EDT / 21:00 CEST / 5:00am AEST. Expect to play ''at least'' 3 hours, with the possibility of having to play for longer.
* '''Saturday August 14th:''' Tournament resumes at 3:00pm EDT / 21:00 CEST / 5:00am AEST. Played until we reach the Grand Finals.
* '''Thursday August 19th:''' 8:00pm EDT / 02:00 CEST / 10:00am AEST - The Grand Finals will play two Best-of-Five series (2x bo5) regardless of score to fill the two-hour QuakeWorld block on the big screen.

